[00:00.00]I've given up again, maybe I'm just tired
[00:00.00]我又选择了放弃 或许只是太疲惫
[00:06.92]Of thinking that there was one way, only one way out
[00:06.92]总以为只有一条出路 唯一解脱途径
[00:12.03]I was hoping by now, that maybe I'd have found
[00:12.03]曾期待时至今日 或许已找到谜底
[00:18.05]Answers to the questions that are keeping me down
[00:18.05]能解答那些 让我沉沦的难题
[00:23.74]Even though I'm not over it yet
[00:23.74]虽然我尚未真正释怀
[00:29.32]I can put forever in the plans that you have
[00:29.32]却愿将永恒写入你的蓝图里
[00:34.76]Stupid and low with the odds that you bet
[00:34.76]明知胜算渺茫仍执迷
[00:40.32]I can put forever in the plans that you have
[00:40.32]我愿把永恒刻进你的计划里
[00:47.27]Take my life and start it somewhere else
[00:47.27]带走我的人生 在别处重启
[00:52.10]I breathe in the change
[00:52.10]呼吸着改变的契机
[00:56.02]The only way is up again
[00:56.02]唯一出路是再度崛起
